<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" modified="2026-11-15T01:35:00.000Z" agent="Antigravity AI Architecture Agent" version="24.0.0" type="device">
  <diagram id="diag_saga_pattern_fase_4" name="Saga Pattern Coreografado (Fase 4)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2360" dy="1520" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2360" pageHeight="1520" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#0F172A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=1;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;ARQUITETURA DO SAGA PATTERN COREOGRAFADO — TRANSAÇÕES DISTRIBUÍDAS E COMPENSAÇÃO (FASE 4)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px; font-weight: normal; opacity: 0.9;&quot;&gt;Choreographed Saga (ADR-015) • 4 Microsserviços (EKS) • 5 Filas AWS SQS + 5 DLQs (ADR-017) • Outbox GSI Schedulers • Circuit Breaker Mercado Pago (ADR-018) • W3C traceparent (ADR-022)&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="66" width="2280" x="40" y="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;width=790;height=28;boundedLbl=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1.6;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;1. FLUXO NOMINAL DA SAGA COREOGRAFADA (FORWARD TRANSACTIONS T1 ➔ T6 &amp;amp; BARRAMENTO AWS SQS + DLQs)&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="588" width="2280" x="40" y="104" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#15803D;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;T1 • register-service (EKS :8080)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;RDS PostgreSQL 16 (register-db) + ElastiCache Redis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• Autenticação JWT (API GW + Lambda Auth OpenFeign).&lt;br/&gt;• Valida e mantém customer_id e vehicle_id ACID no RDS.&lt;br/&gt;• Impede exclusão com OS ativa via ServiceOrderClient.&lt;br/&gt;• Zero acoplamento de banco com demais serviços.&lt;br/&gt;• Referências UUID repassadas via REST para abertura da OS." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="185" width="440" x="65" y="162" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;T2 / T4 / T6 • service-order-execution-service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;DynamoDB tb-service_order (Single-Table Design)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• T2: Grava METADATA (WAITING_APPROVAL) + EXEC# + HIST#.&lt;br/&gt;• T4: Consome aceite ➔ IN_EXECUTION (e Sub-Saga Extras)&lt;br/&gt;  ➔ checkCompletion() transita OS para FINALIZED + GSI PENDING.&lt;br/&gt;• T6: Consome pagamento ➔ atualiza OS para PAID + HIST#.&lt;br/&gt;• Preserva origin_trace_id (W3C traceparent) fim a fim." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="185" width="535" x="620" y="162" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BE185D;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;T3 • notification-service (Stateless)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;EKS :8080 • SMTP / Mailpit + Portal Aprovação&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• Worker stateless orientado a eventos SQS (sem DB próprio).&lt;br/&gt;• T3: Consome orçamento, envia e-mail ao cliente e recebe&lt;br/&gt;  decisão humana em POST /notifications/approval/{orderId}.&lt;br/&gt;• Emite CallbackApprovalMessage na fila callback SQS.&lt;br/&gt;• T5/T6/C4: Dispara alertas PIX, recibos e estornos SMTP." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="185" width="465" x="1270" y="162" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;T5 / T6 • payment-service (EKS :8080)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;DynamoDB tb-payment + Mercado Pago CB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• T5: Consome cobrança e cria ordem PIX no Mercado Pago&lt;br/&gt;  protegido por Resilience4j Circuit Breaker (fallback PIX).&lt;br/&gt;• Grava PAY# (PENDING) + INV# (PK: BILLING#&amp;lt;orderId&amp;gt;).&lt;br/&gt;• T6: Webhook ou POST /confirm muda PAY# ➔ APPROVED&lt;br/&gt;  e publica liquidação (SQS 5) + recibo (SQS 4)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="185" width="450" x="1845" y="162" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#15803D;fontColor=#15803D;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.7;" value="T1: REST UUIDs&#10;customerId + vehicleId"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="505" y="255" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="620" y="255" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;SQS 1: approve-notification-queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;DLQ: approve-notification-dlq (maxReceiveCount = 3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• Evento T2: OrderApprovalEvent (Orçamento OS)&lt;br/&gt;• Produtor: service-order-execution-service&lt;br/&gt;• Consumidor: notification-service&lt;br/&gt;• Payload: serviceOrderId, totalPrice, items, traceparent" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="165" width="420" x="65" y="452" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;SQS 2: callback-approve-notification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;DLQ: callback-approve-notification-dlq (maxReceive = 3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• Evento T3/C1: CallbackApprovalMessage&lt;br/&gt;• Produtor: notification-service (POST /approval/{id})&lt;br/&gt;• Consumidor: service-order-execution-service&lt;br/&gt;• Payload: serviceOrderId, approved (true|false), reason" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="165" width="420" x="520" y="452" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;SQS 3: os-ready-for-payment-queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;DLQ: os-ready-for-payment-dlq (maxReceive = 3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• Evento T4: OsReadyForPaymentEvent (Outbox GSI 30m)&lt;br/&gt;• Produtor: service-order-execution-service (FINALIZED)&lt;br/&gt;• Consumidor: payment-service (PaymentSqsConsumer)&lt;br/&gt;• Payload: serviceOrderId, customerId, priceValue" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="165" width="420" x="975" y="452" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;SQS 4: payment-notification-queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;DLQ: payment-notification-dlq (maxReceive = 3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• Eventos T5/T6/C3/C4: ready / approved / refunded&lt;br/&gt;• Produtor: payment-service (Outbox GSI 15m)&lt;br/&gt;• Consumidor: notification-service (E-mail PIX/Recibo)&lt;br/&gt;• Payload: paymentId, status, brCodePix, refundReason" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="165" width="420" x="1430" y="452" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;SQS 5: payment-success-queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;DLQ: payment-success-dlq (maxReceiveCount = 3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• Evento T6: PaymentSuccessEvent (Liquidação OS)&lt;br/&gt;• Produtor: payment-service (Webhook / Confirm)&lt;br/&gt;• Consumidor: service-order-execution-service&lt;br/&gt;• Efeito na OS: METADATA ➔ PAID + registro HIST#" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="165" width="410" x="1885" y="452" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#0F766E;fontColor=#0F766E;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.7;" value="T2: Pub Orçamento"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="665" y="372" /><mxPoint x="275" y="372" /></Array><mxPoint x="665" y="347" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="275" y="452" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#BE185D;fontColor=#BE185D;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.7;dashed=1;" value="T3: Consome Orçamento ➔ Envia E-mail"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="275" y="646" /><mxPoint x="1412" y="646" /></Array><mxPoint x="275" y="617" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1412" y="347" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="16" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#BE185D;fontColor=#BE185D;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.7;" value="T3 / C1: Pub Decisão Cliente"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1330" y="398" /><mxPoint x="795" y="398" /></Array><mxPoint x="1330" y="347" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="795" y="452" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#0F766E;fontColor=#0F766E;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.7;dashed=1;" value="T4 / C1: Callback"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="715" y="452" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="715" y="347" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="18" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#0F766E;fontColor=#0F766E;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.7;" value="T4: Outbox OS FINALIZED"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1055" y="347" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1055" y="452" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="19" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;fontColor=#1D4ED8;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.7;dashed=1;" value="T5: Consome OS Pronta ➔ Cria PIX / MP"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1185" y="672" /><mxPoint x="1867" y="672" /></Array><mxPoint x="1185" y="617" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1867" y="347" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="20" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;fontColor=#1D4ED8;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.7;" value="T5/C4: Pub Aviso"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1985" y="372" /><mxPoint x="1685" y="372" /></Array><mxPoint x="1985" y="347" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1685" y="452" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="21" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#BE185D;fontColor=#BE185D;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.7;dashed=1;" value="Sub Alertas/PIX"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1595" y="452" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1595" y="347" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="22" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;fontColor=#1D4ED8;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.7;" value="T6: Pub Liquidação"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="2155" y="347" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="2155" y="452" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="23" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#0F766E;fontColor=#0F766E;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.7;dashed=1;" value="T6: PaymentSuccessEvent (SQS 5) ➔ pollPaymentSuccess() atualiza OS = PAID + HIST#"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2310" y="534" /><mxPoint x="2310" y="138" /><mxPoint x="950" y="138" /></Array><mxPoint x="2295" y="534" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="950" y="162" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="24" parent="1" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;width=790;height=28;boundedLbl=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=1.6;fontColor=#991B1B;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;2. FLUXOS DE COMPENSAÇÃO SEMÂNTICA E ROLLBACK DISTRIBUÍDO (FALHAS &amp;amp; RECUSAS C1 ➔ C4)&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="295" width="2280" x="40" y="712" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="25" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;C1 • Recusa de Orçamento Inicial (approved = false)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;Rollback de Pré-Execução (Callback SQS 2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• Gatilho: Cliente rejeita orçamento no portal / API Gateway.&lt;br/&gt;• Fluxo: notification-service ➔ callback-approve-notification-queue.&lt;br/&gt;• Ação Compensatória: ApproveServiceOrderImpl recebe approved=false,&lt;br/&gt;  transita OS de WAITING_APPROVAL ➔ REFUSED (ou CANCELED),&lt;br/&gt;  grava trilha HIST# e impede avanço para Execução ou Cobrança.&lt;br/&gt;• Estado Final: ServiceOrderStatus = REFUSED / CANCELED (limpo)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="232" width="535" x="65" y="756" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="26" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C2410C;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;C2 • Recusa de Execuções Extras (extra approve = false)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;Rollback Parcial de Sub-Saga na Oficina&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• Gatilho: Cliente recusa serviços adicionais descobertos no reparo.&lt;br/&gt;• Guarda Domínio: Patch para FINALIZED bloqueado (HTTP 422)&lt;br/&gt;  enquanto OS permanecer em WAITING_APPROVAL_EXTRA_TASKS.&lt;br/&gt;• Ação Compensatória: ManageExtraExecutionsImpl marca EXTRA_EXEC#&lt;br/&gt;  como REFUSED e transita OS ➔ REFUSED_EXTRA_TASKS ➔ IN_EXECUTION.&lt;br/&gt;• Efeito Financeiro: Descarta acréscimo e preserva totalPrice original." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="232" width="535" x="630" y="756" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="27" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;C3 • Falha Gateway MP / Circuit Breaker &amp;amp; Recusa&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;Resiliência Externa &amp;amp; Degradação Graciosa (ADR-018)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• Gatilho: Indisponibilidade Mercado Pago (timeout/5xx) ou recusa PIX.&lt;br/&gt;• Contingência Automática: Resilience4j Circuit Breaker em estado OPEN&lt;br/&gt;  aciona fallback determinístico FALLBACK-MP-* (MERCADO_PAGO_CONTINGENCY)&lt;br/&gt;  gerando BR Code PIX offline válido sem interromper a Saga.&lt;br/&gt;• Em caso de Pagamento Recusado: PAY# = REFUSED; notifica cliente&lt;br/&gt;  via SQS 4 e mantém OS retentável ou disponível para CANCELED." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="232" width="535" x="1195" y="756" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="28" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7E22CE;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;C4 • Estorno Financeiro Pós-Pagamento (Refund)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;Compensação Financeira Integral (Reversão Saga)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• Gatilho: Cancelamento ou inviabilidade após confirmação (PAID).&lt;br/&gt;• Fluxo REST: POST /payment/{id}/refund (ou /order/{orderId}/refund).&lt;br/&gt;• Ação Compensatória: RefundPaymentUseCaseImpl solicita estorno no&lt;br/&gt;  Mercado Pago, grava PAY# com status = REFUNDED, refund_reason e&lt;br/&gt;  refund_date em tb-payment e notifica cliente via SQS 4 (payment_refunded).&lt;br/&gt;• Estado OS: Cancelamento compensatório registrado em HIST#." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="232" width="535" x="1760" y="756" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="29" parent="1" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;width=810;height=28;boundedLbl=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;strokeWidth=1.6;fontColor=#1E3A8A;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;3. GARANTIAS DE CONFIABILIDADE DA SAGA: OUTBOX PATTERN (GSIs), IDEMPOTÊNCIA, DLQs, LIVENESS K8s &amp;amp; W3C TRACEPARENT&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="240" width="2280" x="40" y="1025" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="30" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;⏱️ Outbox Pattern via GSIs do DynamoDB + Schedulers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• scheduler_os_ready_for_payment (30m): Varre GSI pending-dispatch-index&lt;br/&gt;  em tb-service_order (payment_dispatch_status=PENDING) e despacha SQS 3.&lt;br/&gt;• scheduler_os_payment_atualization (15m): Varre GSI dispatch-notification-index&lt;br/&gt;  em tb-payment e garante consistência eventual com SQS 4 e SQS 5.&lt;br/&gt;• Elimina dual-write inconsistente entre persistência NoSQL e publicação SQS." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="178" width="725" x="65" y="1068" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="31" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;🔒 Atomicidade Single-Table, Idempotência &amp;amp; Redrive DLQs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• TransactWriteItems (DynamoTransactionBuilder): gravação atômica de&lt;br/&gt;  METADATA + EXEC# + HIST# na partição ORDER#&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;; preservação de Sort Keys.&lt;br/&gt;• Consumers Idempotentes: deduplicação por serviceOrderId / paymentId previne&lt;br/&gt;  efeitos colaterais na entrega at-least-once do AWS SQS.&lt;br/&gt;• 5 Dead Letter Queues (-dlq): maxReceiveCount = 3 e retenção de 14 dias." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="178" width="725" x="818" y="1068" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="32" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B21A8;strokeWidth=1.7;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;🛡️ Prevenção de Pods Zumbis (ADR-020) &amp;amp; W3C Traceparent (ADR-022)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;• SqsListenerHealthIndicator: monitora heartbeats do polling SQS dentro&lt;br/&gt;  de /actuator/health/liveness; se travar, o EKS reinicia o Pod automaticamente.&lt;br/&gt;• Shutdown Seguro: preStop hook (sleep 10s) + Graceful Shutdown do Spring.&lt;br/&gt;• Rastreabilidade Fim a Fim: traceparent W3C propagado via HTTP e SQS&lt;br/&gt;  (e salvo em origin_trace_id) correlacionando toda a Saga no Jaeger/Grafana." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="178" width="725" x="1570" y="1068" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="33" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;📌 EVOLUÇÃO TRANSACIONAL: FASE 3 (TRANSAÇÃO LOCAL ACID MONOLÍTICA) ➔ FASE 4 (SAGA PATTERN COREOGRAFADO)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Fase 3 (Monólito Relacional Único — RDS PostgreSQL):&lt;/b&gt; Todas as entidades residiam no mesmo banco relacional e as operações executavam sob transações locais ACID (@Transactional do Spring), sem barramento de mensageria, sem eventos distribuídos e sem necessidade de transações compensatórias inter-serviços.&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Fase 4 (Microsserviços Independentes — ADR-014 + ADR-015 + ADR-017 + ADR-018):&lt;/b&gt; Com Database-per-Service (RDS + 2 DynamoDBs), adotou-se a Saga Coreografada sobre 5 filas AWS SQS + 5 DLQs, padrão Outbox por GSIs, Circuit Breaker no Mercado Pago e 4 fluxos explícitos de compensação/estorno (C1–C4) com correlação distribuída W3C traceparent." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="210" width="2280" x="40" y="1285" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
